{"ulaanbaatar":{"id":"3e5667c4-dd5b-4d9c-948c-c9ff741107b0","word":"Ulaanbaatar","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"the capital of Mongolia","tags":["feminine"],"word":"Ulan Bator"}],"pos":"name","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"Mongolia's capital city of Ulaanbaatar has its share of tourist attractions - Genghis Khan Square, the National Museum, the State Opera and Ballet Theatre. But Ger Community Mapping Center guide Tuguldur Chuluunbaatar wants to highlight a different part of the city; a part that's often ignored.","ref":"2017 January 25, Anne Bailey, “Mapping air pollution to conquer it in Mongolia's capital”, in Deutsche Welle, archived from the original on 25 Jan 2017, Environment:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[27,38]],"id":"adbe4be3-ba58-45ae-addb-86e3de27455d"},{"text":"Mongolia will supply critical metals to France needed for its energy transition, President Emmanuel Macron said on Sunday during the first ever visit to Ulaanbaatar by a serving French president.","ref":"2023 May 21, Michel Rose, “Mongolia to supply critical metals to France, Macron says”, in Reuters, archived from the original on 22 May 2023, Commodities:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[153,164]],"id":"f0f5e51d-7324-4384-a005-c150b13776a3"},{"text":"In one of the rooms of the center, which will also serve as a temporary shelter for immigrants who arrive in the city without any point of reference, Francis recalled that when the first missionaries arrived in Ulaanbaatar in the 1990s, they immediately felt a call to charity.","ref":"2023 September 4, “Pope visits charity center in Mongolia, says Church not driven by proselytization”, in EFE, archived from the original on 07 Sep 2023:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[211,222]],"id":"c5bd7504-3964-4455-a8f1-fb9318234297"}],"wikidata":["Q23430"],"senseid":["en:Q23430"],"categories":["English entries with incorrect language header","English lemmas","English proper nouns","